{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.poster.avif?t=1765520657\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.webm?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/a4460b7bf8e0d98d9c47635f639e7bad.mp4?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The girl and the golem fall into the golem kingdom of [Sophiatica].</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of [Sophiatica], once built by alchemists, has now fallen into ruin.<br>Now, it is a den of masterless golems roaming without purpose.<br>Mercouri, a girl wielding a book, and Hando, a hand-shaped golem, have fallen into this kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To revive their friend Hadel, they embark on a journey to find his soul, the Pangenium.<br>The Pangenium has shattered into eight pieces and scattered across the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting foot in Sophiatica, Mercouri and Hando move forward together, helping one another.<br>What secrets and trials await them? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.poster.avif?t=1765520657\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.webm?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/c906877c0f1aba98cd155787bd05b648.mp4?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch characters to outsmart the golems.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri runs across the ground, while Hando flies through the air.<br>But neither of them is perfect.<br>Short Mercouri can\u2019t reach high places, and golem Hando can\u2019t pick up items or interact with objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By switching between the two characters, they can compensate for each other\u2019s weaknesses.<br>Hando helps Mercouri reach higher places, and aerial enemies can be tackled by Hando.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful foes must be lured and defeated through clever character switching.<br>Solve puzzles that one character alone cannot, and win battles by outsmarting the golems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mercouri \u2013 The girl who wields the book</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercouri is a small and seemingly insignificant alchemist girl.<br>She attacks enemies with a flurry of strikes from her soul-infused book.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hando \u2013 The floating fist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hando is a dependable golem who supports the untrustworthy Mercouri.<br>He floats through the air, defeating high-up enemies and discovering hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.poster.avif?t=1765520657\" width=1440 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.webm?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571730/extras/9f0937770465e3fb65c25ed386f512bd.mp4?t=1765520657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden paths, the kingdom of eight hues, and the NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophiatica is a kingdom composed of uniquely themed areas\u2014<br>from underground waterways, blazing hot mining zones, to the climate gardens above the clouds.<br>Each area hides secret paths, items, and mechanics.<br>With a bit of attention, you\u2019ll uncover the kingdom\u2019s subtle secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast and interconnected kingdom is also home to NPCs with their own stories.<br>As Mercouri and Hando go on their adventure, so too do the inhabitants continue their own journeys. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blue Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/13a788e4f280a9e6b51775e903951ed8b5e61506.jpg"},{"name":"Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/e1af8db10e1e57ffbb291c3ba5020b10c75af418.jpg"},{"name":"The Sheep That Devoured a Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/aa98aeddd804a61c49c5ae7122aee5cb11ef9aa3.jpg"},{"name":"The Law of Clouds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/6873afbeaa42d7f5200709438b845bf334f6b126.jpg"},{"name":"The Lady of the Execution Ground","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/68cf69b21610181be21e1a734c5da91b8f6d3d60.jpg"},{"name":"Dialogue of Steel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/96d526057a7e30c90b74ba4cf7a95ad2c980b1ef.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/505aff0f3bfca0575c4555006a862292a5c18097.jpg"},{"name":"The Other Side of Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2571730/32b90743644a2458478b838f4832787e7913049e.jpg"},{"name":"Photogr